sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as Browser (Applicant)
    participant F as recruit.astro<br/>client JS
    participant API as /api/recruit.ts<br/>(CF Worker)
    participant R2 as R2 bucket MEDIA
    participant D1 as D1 job_applications

    U->>F: Fill form (+ optional resume)
    F->>F: validate() client-side
    Note over F: preventDefault if invalid
    F->>API: POST multipart/form-data (fetch)
    API->>API: Re-validate ALL fields<br/>(Set whitelist + regex + size <=10MB)
    alt Validation fails
        API-->>F: 400 { ok:false, errors }
        F->>U: Highlight error fields
    else Valid
        API->>API: id = crypto.randomUUID()
        API->>R2: put recruit/{id}/resume (if attached)
        R2-->>API: { key, filename }
        API->>D1: ensureApplicationsSchema()
        API->>D1: INSERT job_applications
        D1-->>API: OK
        API-->>F: 200 { ok:true, id }
        F->>U: Show success panel
    end
